    "field_description": [
        {
            "value": "With every new blog there needs to be a first post, so Hello World and welcome to the Stuart Clark Druxt blog. The purpose of this site is to give me a playground, a place to post on the progress and implement the results of my various Decoupled Drupal experiments. This site in itself is the result of an experiment; a Databaseless and Serverless, Statically generated Druxt frontend hosted on the CDN."
